# Tailscale safety

## Read-only default

List devices and status are fine when Tailscale work is authorized. Do **not**:

- replace or broaden the ACL policy without naming the change
- create, reveal, or revoke auth keys into chat
- delete/disable a device or force-expire nodes
- advertise/exit routes the user did not name

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

Prefer minimal ACL diffs. Never paste auth keys or API tokens into chat.
